   304	
   305	We have surveyed the peer-reviewed literature establishing the physical feasibility of the Braided Mind Architecture's functional components. The delivery mechanism, cranial substrate, power system, neural interface, aging management, cellular sensing, and tissue modification capabilities are each independently supported by published science. The integration gap is precisely identified.
   306	
